Package: mineserve
Version: 2.1.4
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), docker.io, sudo, miniupnpc
Maintainer: MineServe contributors
Description: Docker-backed Minecraft server manager and web panel
 MineServe Linux manages multiple Minecraft server containers and provides an
 authenticated web panel for server creation, console, files, and runtime setup.
